{"audio": "1corinthians-10.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 213200, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2000, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Ten."}, {"start_ms": 2000, "end_ms": 18667, "text": "Moreover, brethren, I would not that ye should be ignorant, how that all our fathers were under the cloud, and all passed through the sea; And were all baptized unto Moses in the cloud and in the sea; And did all eat the same spiritual meat; And did all drink the same spiritual drink:"}, {"start_ms": 18667, "end_ms": 23600, "text": "for they drank of that spiritual Rock that followed them: and that Rock was Christ."}, {"start_ms": 23600, "end_ms": 28267, "text": "But with many of them God was not well pleased: for they were overthrown in the wilderness."}, {"start_ms": 28267, "end_ms": 34400, "text": "Now these things were our examples, to the intent we should not lust after evil things, as they also lusted."}, {"start_ms": 34400, "end_ms": 42533, "text": "Neither be ye idolaters, as were some of them; as it is written, The people sat down to eat and drink, and rose up to play."}, {"start_ms": 42533, "end_ms": 48800, "text": "Neither let us commit fornication, as some of them committed, and fell in one day three and twenty thousand."}, {"start_ms": 48800, "end_ms": 54000, "text": "Neither let us tempt Christ, as some of them also tempted, and were destroyed of serpents."}, {"start_ms": 54000, "end_ms": 59333, "text": "Neither murmur ye, as some of them also murmured, and were destroyed of the destroyer."}, {"start_ms": 59333, "end_ms": 67467, "text": "Now all these things happened unto them for ensamples: and they are written for our admonition, upon whom the ends of the world are come."}, {"start_ms": 67467, "end_ms": 71733, "text": "Wherefore let him that thinketh he standeth take heed lest he fall."}, {"start_ms": 71733, "end_ms": 86267, "text": "There hath no temptation taken you but such as is common to man: but God is faithful, who will not suffer you to be tempted above that ye are able; but will with the temptation also make a way to escape, that ye may be able to bear it."}, {"start_ms": 86267, "end_ms": 89733, "text": "Wherefore, my dearly beloved, flee from idolatry."}, {"start_ms": 89733, "end_ms": 93067, "text": "I speak as to wise men; judge ye what I say."}, {"start_ms": 93067, "end_ms": 98000, "text": "The cup of blessing which we bless, is it not the communion of the blood of Christ?"}, {"start_ms": 98000, "end_ms": 102667, "text": "The bread which we break, is it not the communion of the body of Christ?"}, {"start_ms": 102667, "end_ms": 108400, "text": "For we being many are one bread, and one body: for we are all partakers of that one bread."}, {"start_ms": 108400, "end_ms": 114400, "text": "Behold Israel after the flesh: are not they which eat of the sacrifices partakers of the altar?"}, {"start_ms": 114400, "end_ms": 116000, "text": "What say I then?"}, {"start_ms": 116000, "end_ms": 121200, "text": "that the idol is any thing, or that which is offered in sacrifice to idols is any thing?"}, {"start_ms": 121200, "end_ms": 131333, "text": "But I say, that the things which the Gentiles sacrifice, they sacrifice to devils, and not to God: and I would not that ye should have fellowship with devils."}, {"start_ms": 131333, "end_ms": 139067, "text": "Ye cannot drink the cup of the Lord, and the cup of devils: ye cannot be partakers of the Lord's table, and of the table of devils."}, {"start_ms": 139067, "end_ms": 141333, "text": "Do we provoke the Lord to jealousy?"}, {"start_ms": 141333, "end_ms": 142800, "text": "are we stronger than he?"}, {"start_ms": 142800, "end_ms": 150800, "text": "All things are lawful for me, but all things are not expedient: all things are lawful for me, but all things edify not."}, {"start_ms": 150800, "end_ms": 154400, "text": "Let no man seek his own, but every man another's wealth."}, {"start_ms": 154400, "end_ms": 162133, "text": "Whatsoever is sold in the shambles, that eat, asking no question for conscience sake: For the earth is the Lord's, and the fulness thereof."}, {"start_ms": 162133, "end_ms": 171867, "text": "If any of them that believe not bid you to a feast, and ye be disposed to go; whatsoever is set before you, eat, asking no question for conscience sake."}, {"start_ms": 171867, "end_ms": 189867, "text": "But if any man say unto you, This is offered in sacrifice unto idols, eat not for his sake that shewed it, and for conscience sake: for the earth is the Lord's, and the fulness thereof: Conscience, I say, not thine own, but of the other: for why is my liberty judged of another man's conscience?"}, {"start_ms": 189867, "end_ms": 195467, "text": "For if I by grace be a partaker, why am I evil spoken of for that for which I give thanks?"}, {"start_ms": 195467, "end_ms": 201467, "text": "Whether therefore ye eat, or drink, or whatsoever ye do, do all to the glory of God."}, {"start_ms": 201467, "end_ms": 213200, "text": "Give none offence, neither to the Jews, nor to the Gentiles, nor to the church of God: Even as I please all men in all things, not seeking mine own profit, but the profit of many, that they may be saved."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 465, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 465, "e": 1172, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1232, "e": 1576, "si": 0}, {"t": "Ten.", "s": 1616, "e": 1838, "si": 0}, {"t": "Moreover,", "s": 2440, "e": 2820, "si": 1}, {"t": "brethren,", "s": 2880, "e": 3261, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 3461, "e": 3501, "si": 1}, {"t": "would", "s": 3521, "e": 3681, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 3821, "e": 4041, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 4101, "e": 4241, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 4281, "e": 4341, "si": 1}, {"t": "should", "s": 4421, "e": 4601, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 4621, "e": 4701, "si": 1}, {"t": "ignorant,", "s": 4821, "e": 5221, "si": 1}, {"t": "how", "s": 5341, "e": 5481, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 5501, "e": 5642, "si": 1}, {"t": "all", "s": 5702, "e": 5822, "si": 1}, {"t": "our", "s":